- @left_maj: We can form a majority government!
- @redred: Form a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span> coalition ([+ berlin_pot_rot_rot +]%)
- @rrgreen: Form a <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition ([+ berlin_pot_rot_rot_grun +]%)
- @groko: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Grand</span> <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">coalition</span> be formed ([+ berlin_pot_groko +]%).
- @ampel: Let a <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">Traffic</span> <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">Light</span> <span style="color: [+ fdp_color +];">coalition</span> be formed ([+ berlin_pot_traffic_light +]%).
- @jamaica: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Ja</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">mai</span><span style="color: [+ fdp_color +];">can</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_jamaica +]%).
- @kenya: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Ken</span><span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">yan co</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">alition</span> be formed ([+ berlin_pot_kenya +]%).
- @midnight: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Mid</span><span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">night</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_schwarz_blau +]%).
- @tigerente: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Tiger</span><span style="color: [+ fdp_color +];">ente</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_tigerente +]%).
- @kiwi: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Ki</span><span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">wi</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_kiwi +]%).
- @redgreen: Let a <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">Red</span>-<span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">green</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_rot_grun +]%).
- @germany: Let a <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">Ger</span><span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">ma</span><span style="color: [+ fdp_color +];">ny</span> coalition be formed ([+ berlin_pot_weimar_but_different +]%).
- @afd_maj: The <span style="color: [+ afd_color +];">AfD</span> secures a majority.
- @cdu_maj: The <span style="color: [+ cdu_color +];">CDU</span> secures a majority.
- @spd_maj: The <span style="color: [+ spd_color +];">SPD</span> secures a majority.
- @greens_maj: The <span style="color: [+ greens_color +];">Greens</span> secure a majority.

